    "1": {
      "note": "喺 (hai2) means “to be at / in / on” — 我喺屋企 (ngo5 hai2 uk1 kei2) = “I’m at home”. To say where something is, put a position word after the place: 喺枱上面 (hai2 toi2 soeng6 min6) = “on the table”, 喺箱入面 (hai2 soeng1 jap6 min6) = “inside the box”. Common ones: 上面 (soeng6 min6, on), 下面 (haa6 min6, under), 入面 (jap6 min6, inside), 出面 (ceot1 min6, outside).",
