          "j": "ngo5 hai2 uk1 kei2.",
          "e": "I'm at home.",
          "note": "喺 (hai2) alone can mean \"to be at (a place)\" — 我喺屋企 (ngo5 hai2 uk1 kei2) \"I'm at home\", no other verb needed. (Don't swap in 係 hai6 \"to be\" — for location it's always 喺 hai2.)",
